{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":136129,"name":"Patrick Garrett","username":"pops","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.ghost.org/pops/{size}/27564_2.png","created_at":"2025-04-28T15:40:19.785Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI’m looking for someone with experience to assist me in implementing the best strategy to merge two websites together in Ghost.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSite 1 - existing Ghsot website located at \u003ca href=\"http://bourbonbanter.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ebourbonbanter.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSite 2 - existing WP website located at \u003ca href=\"http://drinkcurious.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003edrinkcurious.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI want to position everything under \u003ca href=\"http://drinkcurious.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003edrinkcurious.com\u003c/a\u003e with the \u003ca href=\"http://bourbonbanter.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ebourbonbanter.com\u003c/a\u003e content becoming the blog component/library under DrinkCurious. So i need to take the design approach from DC and overlay onto BB and create a new homepage to match and pull over all existing pages to be built in Ghost for DC.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn my mind this means a new or customized theme that supports the DC design branding and website homepage approach with a blog component that is the current BB site content.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf this is something you’ve done before or can support please let me know. Thanks!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2025-04-28T15:40:19.785Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":32,"reads":16,"readers_count":15,"score":163.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":57157,"topic_slug":"help-combining-a-wp-site-onto-existing-ghost-site","display_username":"Patrick Garrett","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://drinkcurious.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"DrinkCurious - In-person and Virtual Spirit Tastings","clicks":5},{"url":"http://bourbonbanter.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Bourbon \u0026 Banter 🥃 - #1 Rated Bourbon Reviews","clicks":4}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":16915,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/help-combining-a-wp-site-onto-existing-ghost-site/57157/1","calendar_details":[],"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":136131,"name":"Cathy Sarisky (Spectral Web Services)","username":"Cathy_Sarisky","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.ghost.org/cathy_sarisky/{size}/25750_2.png","created_at":"2025-04-28T16:07:32.828Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThe question you’ll need to resolve is how you’re going to manage these two sites, and what level of relatedness you need.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasiest:  BB lives at \u003ca href=\"http://bourbonbanter.com\"\u003ebourbonbanter.com\u003c/a\u003e or \u003ca href=\"http://bb.drinkcurious.com\"\u003ebb.drinkcurious.com\u003c/a\u003e – in other words, its own URL.  Match the styling of the BB ghost install to the DC site, update links, and you’re done.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMore complex:  BB lives at \u003ca href=\"http://drinkcurious.com/bourbonbanter\"\u003edrinkcurious.com/bourbonbanter\u003c/a\u003e .  That’s going to require a subdirectory setup.  You’ll need a proxy out in front that figures out based on URL whether any particular request goes to WP or Ghost.  You’ll also need either Ghost setup in a subdirectory install (available at Ghost Pro but higher tier and extra charge), or for your proxy to do a whole bunch of URL rewriting.  Plus the styling.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso complex:  Set up Ghost to run headless (loses membership benefits).  Have the WP site use Ghost as a data source for the blog pages.  (Would require custom work on WP.)\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2025-04-28T16:07:32.828Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":16,"readers_count":15,"score":13.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":57157,"topic_slug":"help-combining-a-wp-site-onto-existing-ghost-site","display_username":"Cathy Sarisky (Spectral Web Services)","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://bb.drinkcurious.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":2},{"url":"http://bourbonbanter.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Bourbon \u0026 Banter 🥃 - #1 Rated Bourbon Reviews","clicks":1},{"url":"http://drinkcurious.com/bourbonbanter","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":12499,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/help-combining-a-wp-site-onto-existing-ghost-site/57157/2","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":136132,"name":"Patrick Garrett","username":"pops","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.ghost.org/pops/{size}/27564_2.png","created_at":"2025-04-28T16:28:31.093Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks for your input, Cathy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe BB site currently has 18K+ subs so that would need to be the core of what I build upon. I don’t want to migrate them over, especially with some of those being paid members integrated with Stripe, etc.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI was imagining a scenario where someone visits \u003ca href=\"http://drinkcurious.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003edrinkcurious.com\u003c/a\u003e, they get an experience similar to what they get now with a website homepage (vs a blog homepage). Menu sysmte provides access to existing page structure from \u003ca href=\"http://DrinkCurious.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eDrinkCurious.com\u003c/a\u003e and a some nav that goes to a new blog homepage (a new page created to mimic the functionality of the current BB homepage) and nav to category pages like I have now. I would adjust redirects at the domain level so that I don’t have to push the blog content into a sub-directory or other structure. (e.g., \u003ca href=\"https://www.bourbonbanter.com/proof-of-life-full-circle/\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eProof of Life: Full Circle\u003c/a\u003e becomes \u003ca href=\"https://www.drinkcurious.com/proof-of-life-full-circle/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://www.drinkcurious.com/proof-of-life-full-circle/\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI suppose in simplest terms, the user experience is a new homepage experience, DrinkCurious URL and brandinging support applied on top of existing BB ghost stack. Then fix BB domain mapping issues to hopefully not skip a beat.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf this approach is feasible, I just need someone that can help build out the new homepage for my current theme (or modified theme to allow for DC branding), and implement a blog homepage that mimics the current BB homepage.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2025-04-28T16:28:31.093Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":2,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":13,"readers_count":12,"score":2.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":57157,"topic_slug":"help-combining-a-wp-site-onto-existing-ghost-site","display_username":"Patrick Garrett","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://drinkcurious.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"DrinkCurious - In-person and Virtual Spirit Tastings","clicks":1},{"url":"http://DrinkCurious.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"DrinkCurious - In-person and Virtual Spirit Tastings","clicks":1},{"url":"https://www.drinkcurious.com/proof-of-life-full-circle/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"https://www.bourbonbanter.com/proof-of-life-full-circle/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Proof of Life: Full Circle","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":12499,"username":"Cathy_Sarisky","name":"Cathy Sarisky (Spectral Web Services)","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.ghost.org/cathy_sarisky/{size}/25750_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":16915,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/help-combining-a-wp-site-onto-existing-ghost-site/57157/3","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[136129,136131,13